            "title": "金價對沖獲利3億 六福中期盈利升成半",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"672\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0eb68efe27cca28236a409c4eb6d7c209f92da86221591e58baa1be6957c3bc6/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w1200%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fthe_bamboo_works_186%2F4a4c8215e56eea9bc89d82aa4cb11338\" width=\"1200\"/></div></figure></div>",
