        {
            "title": "美股期指在感恩節淡靜交投中上揚，科技股反彈成焦點",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"Kopin獲美國陸軍1,860萬美元MicroLED顯示器合約，股價盤後漲4.8%\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9a88cc5721c7952ba74da9841f1846e59fb9721c06e8cf9adcd2e9be390147a4/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w1200%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXMPEM4R1OV_M.jpg\" width=\"1200\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:1200px\">Kopin獲美國陸軍1,860萬美元MicroLED顯示器合約，股價盤後漲4.8%</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Investing.com — 美國股指期貨於週四晚間上漲，市場期待遭受重創的科技股及人工智能相關估值出現更多反彈跡象。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">由於感恩節假期影響，市場交投明顯清淡，華爾街週五亦將迎來縮短交易時段。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">截至美國東部時間下午6:39（北京時間週五上午6:39），標普500指數期貨上漲0.65%，報7,243.0點；納斯達克100指數期貨上漲0.55%，報26,244.745點；道指期貨上漲0.58%，報50,523.0點。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-b7dcb6cd-7465-3bde-9b1c-67ac49efed76-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">市場焦點主要集中在科技板塊估值的反彈走勢上。此前，科技板塊在10月及11月持續大幅下跌，跌幅深且持久。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">反彈跡象於週三華爾街主要交易時段開始浮現。當日美股指數在大幅低開後逐步收復失地，最終遠高於盤中低位收盤，部分逢低買盤亦為市場估值提供支撐。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">納斯達克綜合指數盤中一度重挫4.5%，最終收窄跌幅至0.6%。標普500下跌0.25%，道瓊斯工業平均指數則上漲0.3%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">週四歐洲及亞洲市場整體表現積極，科技股普遍反彈，預計將為華爾街帶來正面的開市動力。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">儘管如此，華爾街11月整體仍錄得顯著跌幅，主要基準指數跌幅介乎3%至7.3%之間。納斯達克指數表現最為遜色，科技股估值持續下挫令該指數承壓明顯。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">過去兩個月，市場對人工智能前景的疑慮與日俱增——投資者擔憂在利率持續上升的環境下，依賴大規模舉債推動的AI投資熱潮能否持續，這引發了資金大規模撤離科技板塊。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">與此同時，輝達（NASDAQ:NVDA）爆發的企業管治醜聞導致美國進一步收緊對華芯片出口限制，令科技板塊再受衝擊；市場對聯準會將於12月加息的預期日益強烈，亦進一步打壓科技股情緒。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><em>此文章由人工智能協助翻譯。更多資訊，請參閱我們的使用條款。</em></p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E7%BE%8E%E8%82%A1%E6%9C%9F%E6%8C%87%E5%9C%A8%E6%84%9F%E6%81%A9%E7%AF%80%E6%B7%A1%E9%9D%9C%E4%BA%A4%E6%8A%95%E4%B8%AD%E4%B8%8A%E6%8F%9A-%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80%E8%82%A1%E5%8F%8D%E5%BD%88%E6%88%90%E7%84%A6%E9%BB%9E-010122358.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-27 09:17:23",
            "source": "yahoo_finance_asia",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "今日我咁睇｜感恩節變化不大 港股下跌邏輯未變 恒指阻力22400點｜小編苟豪",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"1200\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0bcb498bac9f2b23da2f588a789ec5fba6f67f05786ce4721471fc13b979f5da/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w1200%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fbossmind_356%2Fa474492dcff59f01907cb0681a12b3b7.jpg_up.jpg\" width=\"1200\"/></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">1.昨晚美國感恩節，美股全日休市。美股期貨在交投淡靜下微升約0.6%，外圍變化不大。留意今日是黑色星期五，美股將提早於收市。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">2.港股昨日恒指升約1.2%，收約22230點，重上22000點，結束連跌七日的走勢。昨日早段一度抽上22500點之上，其後大家照趁高沽貨走人，收市接近全日低位。今日開市早段升幅亦不多。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">3.正如昨日所言，即使再彈上22000點之上，基本邏輯未變。聯儲局12月加息幾乎已成定局，港股弱勢持續。上方蟹貨仍多，拒絕接火棒。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-91543400-bca0-3840-b5eb-d1782b612bcb-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">4.指數方面，短線阻力先看22500點，支持則看22000點及21600點。失守22000點機會仍高。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">5.恒指牛熊證街貨比例，牛證約39%、熊證約61%，熊證明顯多於牛證，差距較昨日略為收窄，相反理論略支持大戶挾上殺熊，但基本因素仍淡，若有反彈，不妨先減磅。</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E4%BB%8A%E6%97%A5%E6%88%91%E5%92%81%E7%9D%87-%E6%84%9F%E6%81%A9%E7%AF%80%E8%AE%8A%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%8D%E5%A4%A7-%E6%B8%AF%E8%82%A1%E4%B8%8B%E8%B7%8C%E9%82%8F%E8%BC%AF%E6%9C%AA%E8%AE%8A-%E6%81%92%E6%8C%87%E9%98%BB%E5%8A%9B22400%E9%BB%9E-%E5%B0%8F%E7%B7%A8%E8%8B%9F%E8%B1%AA-020000275.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-27 10:06:57",
            "source": "yahoo_finance_asia",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "馬斯克宣布每年額外向美國兒童捐贈一股SpaceX股份",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"TD Cowen點名卡車運輸與物流板塊首選股，應對成本上升挑戰\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/279205242b4d2acb9605f70998709edd57a72d7fe73987ebd9107f24187a44d9/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w1200%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXNPEAB20CL_M.jpg\" width=\"1200\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:1200px\">TD Cowen點名卡車運輸與物流板塊首選股，應對成本上升挑戰</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Investing.com - 伊隆·馬斯克（Elon Musk）週四表示，他將每年額外向美國所有兒童各捐贈一股SpaceX股份。此前，他已承諾向每名美國兒童捐贈兩股SpaceX股份。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">馬斯克本週早些時候表示，每名美國兒童將獲得兩股SpaceX股份，其中一股來自他本人，另一股來自公司。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">馬斯克在社交媒體上發文表示：「由我本人直接捐出的股份，將於明年6月鎖定期屆滿後完成轉讓。」</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">另外，SpaceX週三宣布，將向每個目前有效的「特朗普帳戶」各捐贈一股新發行的A類普通股。「特朗普帳戶」是美國政府於2025年推出的一項計劃，性質類似於針對18歲以下美國兒童的個人退休儲蓄帳戶。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-cfd8bb89-c490-3faf-92c5-4ee1e1f98451-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">SpaceX總裁格溫·肖特韋爾（Gwynne Shotwell）及其丈夫已於去年10月承諾，將其持有的SpaceX股份捐贈給逾200萬名兒童，以響應這一計劃。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><em>此文章由人工智能協助翻譯。更多資訊，請參閱我們的使用條款。</em></p></div>",
