            "title": "〈台股盤前要聞〉富邦006208分割投票開跑、華南金前10月獲利284億元超過去年",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"676\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1b1c24ba4a7088f8c81997c724d4c05957a30a896109fa20f71a90748a425494/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w1200%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fcnyes_hk_559%2Fcc33c9b7428ecdd674602e1a3dea1225.jpg\" width=\"1200\"/></div></figure></div>",
